    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The paper presents two case studies: math word problems and multi-hop question answering. The results show that <strong>DSPy programs outperform systems using hand-crafted prompts</strong>, and that <strong>compiling the correct modules</strong> can improve different language models from 4-20% accuracy to 49-88% accuracy.",
